<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU INDEX CLIMBS 1.12 PERCENT TO 152.12.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU INDEX CLIMBS 1.12 PERCENT TO 152.12.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rietumu index climbed 1.12 percent on Wednesday to 152.12, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 722 66 93</p>
